Hubungi saya,

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:36.880
Mirko Peters,

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:37.260
di LinkedIn.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:38.900
Dan kirimkan saya hambatan

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:39.840
alur kerja berikutnya

